    {
      "id": "distance",
      "title": "Distance of a point from a line",
      "notes": "The perpendicular distance of $(x_1, y_1)$ from $Ax + By + C = 0$ is\n$$d = \\frac{|Ax_1 + By_1 + C|}{\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2}}$$\n\nThe distance between the parallel lines $Ax + By + C_1 = 0$ and $Ax + By + C_2 = 0$ is\n$$d = \\frac{|C_1 - C_2|}{\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2}}$$",
      "widget": {
